cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "Goyal"
    given-names: "Naman"
    affiliation: "Indian Institute of Science (IISc), Bangalore"
title: "SMVac: Standard Model electroweak vacuum stability — analytical approximations versus a numerical reference"
version: 2.0.0-dev
url: "https://github.com/namangoyal31/SMVac"
repository-code: "https://github.com/namangoyal31/SMVac"
abstract: >-
  Three-loop renormalization-group evolution of the Standard Model couplings, the RG-improved effective quartic,
  and the tree-level O(4) bounce action of the electroweak vacuum computed with a validated numerical reference
  (spectral collocation), compared against the Fubini-Lipatov analytical approximation used in the literature,
  a rigorous lower bound, a variational upper estimate and a curvature-corrected estimate.
keywords:
  - vacuum stability
  - Higgs boson
  - renormalization group
  - bounce action
  - vacuum decay
